{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1504691-the-guide-deus-ex-machina-ability","id":1504691,"title":"The Guide 'deus ex machina' Ability","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-03-06T18:36:52-08:00","id":1504691,"title":"The Guide 'deus ex machina' Ability","content":"OK, so Guides, through the later acceptance of the 'Tempted Fate' Condition, can empower a Scion to act one Tier higher than normal (Hero as Demigod, Demigod as God, etc.). <br /> <br /> Does this mean that, with a guide's assistance, a Hero can make their own Relic, which is a feat normally restricted to Demigods and higher?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T19:16:33-08:00","id":1504702,"title":"","content":"Like if you have a 5-point bond with an iconic item you carry, and you use it in an act of mythic significance while channeling your guide's divine import?<br /> <br /> Sure, I'd allow that. You've already invested in that bond, and then Fatebound it in an act of demigod scale. You wrote a legend into the World.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-09T21:22:17-08:00","id":1505001,"title":"","content":"Good to know, but I actually meant making a Relic as per the item crafting rules, rather than spontaneous mythic imprinting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-10T03:40:25-08:00","id":1505014,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shkspr1048</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1504691-the-guide-deus-ex-machina-ability?p=1505001#post1505001\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Good to know, but I actually meant making a Relic as per the item crafting rules, rather than spontaneous mythic imprinting.</div> </div> </div> </div>A guide can elevate the power of your divinity for one scene per full story arc. Crafting a relic is a complex action building on intervals suggested to take an episode's worth of unrolled story effort each. Usually one of these timespans is significantly longer than the other.<br /> <br /> Hypothetically it's not impossible. If you've stocked up prizes and connections from several past adventures and are just assembling them in that one scene of ascended divinity, there may be situations where it's suitable. By default I would suggest no, especially for crafting projects where you're not simply taking several rare ingredients and assembling them together. Intervals don't just cover ingredients. They can also be access to labor and equipment or ritual performances, where the actual &quot;crafting&quot; being done is not just the final crafting time with milestones completed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}